{"seq":1,"slug":"literary-scholarship","title":"文学研究方法","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/literary-scholarship","introMarkdown":"# 文学研究方法 简介\n\n文学研究方法是人文学科博士训练中最具多元性的领域之一。与社会科学追求可重复验证不同，文学研究往往在阐释的深度与独创性中寻求学术价值，研究者需要在文本细读、历史语境、理论框架之间找到自己的学术立足点。\n\n本学科涵盖三个核心章节，从研究范式的选择到数据处理方法，再到学术写作与发表的全流程。\n\n第一章**研究范式与设计**聚焦于文学研究的基本方法论取向。从新批评的形式主义细读，到新历史主义的语境还原，再到后结构主义、后殖民主义等理论驱动的批评实践，研究者需要理解每种范式的认识论预设及其对研究问题的塑造作用。\n\n第二章**数据与分析方法**探讨文学研究中\"材料\"的获取与处理。档案研究与文本考证是传统核心技能；数字人文和计算文学研究正在重塑学科边界；比较文学与跨学科方法则要求研究者在语言、文化和学科之间建立对话。\n\n第三章**写作与学术评审**关注文学学术写作的特殊性。文学论证不同于科学论证，它依赖修辞策略与阐释说服力；学术发表的规范与期刊文化有其独特生态；博士论文的整体设计则需要将研究问题、方法选择和章节结构融为有机整体。\n\n建议按章节顺序学习：先建立方法论视野，再掌握具体研究技能，最后聚焦学术产出。每一节都提供了从经典到前沿的参考路径，帮助研究者形成自己的方法论自觉。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"paradigms-and-design","title":"研究范式与设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/literary-scholarship/paradigms-and-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"close-reading-and-formalism","title":"博士阶段 文学研究方法 — 细读与形式主义","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/literary-scholarship/paradigms-and-design/close-reading-and-formalism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"historicism-and-contextualism","title":"博士阶段 文学研究方法 — 历史主义与语境研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/literary-scholarship/paradigms-and-design/historicism-and-contextualism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"theory-driven-approaches","title":"博士阶段 文学研究方法 — 理论驱动的批评实践","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/literary-scholarship/paradigms-and-design/theory-driven-approaches"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-and-analysis","title":"数据与分析方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/literary-scholarship/data-and-analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"archival-and-textual-research","title":"博士阶段 文学研究方法 — 档案与文本研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/literary-scholarship/data-and-analysis/archival-and-textual-research"},{"seq":2,"slug":"computational-literary-studies","title":"博士阶段 文学研究方法 — 计算文学研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/literary-scholarship/data-and-analysis/computational-literary-studies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"comparative-and-interdisciplinary","title":"博士阶段 文学研究方法 — 比较与跨学科方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/literary-scholarship/data-and-analysis/comparative-and-interdisciplinary"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"writing-and-review","title":"写作与学术评审","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/literary-scholarship/writing-and-review","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"literary-argumentation","title":"博士阶段 文学研究方法 — 文学论证的构建","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/literary-scholarship/writing-and-review/literary-argumentation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"scholarly-editing-publishing","title":"博士阶段 文学研究方法 — 学术编辑与发表","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/literary-scholarship/writing-and-review/scholarly-editing-publishing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dissertation-design-literature","title":"博士阶段 文学研究方法 — 文学博士论文设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/literature/literary-scholarship/writing-and-review/dissertation-design-literature"}]}]}